  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模组。充满爱意打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>GUI Effect Timer 是一款客户端模组，它会在屏幕上的状态效果图标下方添加计时器。&nbsp;支持秒、分、时、天的缩写格式。该计时器每刻更新一次，让你能精确看到效果即将结束的时刻。当你身处岩浆并拥有抗火效果时，这非常实用！<br><br>文本颜色可在配置文件中轻松修改，默认为白色。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>timerColourRGB_R</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 255，最小 0，最大 255<br>计时器文本的红色 RGB 值。<br><br><span><strong>timerColourRGB_G</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 255，最小 0，最大 255<br>计时器文本的绿色 RGB 值。<br><br><span><strong>timerColourRGB_B</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 255，最小 0，最大 255<br>计时器文本的蓝色 RGB 值。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"效果展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-effect-timer/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>适用于命令设置的无限值：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-effect-timer/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>文本颜色可配置！此处为金色 -- RGB: 255, 215, 0</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-effect-timer/c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台内，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何内容，请访问我们的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
